screen.COMPATIBILITY=Compatibility
option.VEGETATION_SWAY=Vegetation movement
option.WIND_STRENGTH=Wind strength
option.MOD_LEAVES=Wind in mod leaves
option.MOD_LEAVES.comment=On by default: uses Angelica's treeLeaves dictionary. Off keeps a strict vanilla allowlist.
option.MOD_FLOWERS=Wind in Botania flowers
option.MOD_FLOWERS.comment=Common flowers verified in the installed JAR. Special, double and floating flowers stay static.
value.MOD_FLOWERS.0=Vanilla only
value.MOD_FLOWERS.1=On
option.CLOUD_QUALITY=Cloud quality
option.CLOUD_QUALITY.comment=1: simple blocks. 2: softly bevelled formations. 3: two layers. 0 hides Earth clouds.
option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud formations
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Custom formations replace vanilla silhouettes. Native is a compatibility fallback.
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud coverage
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=Amount of cloud formations; rain gently increases coverage.
option.CLOUD_HEIGHT=Cloud altitude
option.CLOUD_HEIGHT.comment=Custom formation altitude in blocks. Native clouds use the game's altitude.
option.CLOUD_SPEED=Cloud movement speed
option.CLOUD_SPEED.comment=Slow movement of custom formations. Native mode changes tonal billow speed.
option.SKY_STRENGTH=Sky strength
option.SKY_STRENGTH.comment=Blue gradient and soft horizon, following time of day and weather.
option.COLOR_STRENGTH=Color warmth
option.SHADE_SOFTNESS=Vanilla shade relief
option.SHADE_SOFTNESS.comment=Relieves outdoor vanilla face shading while preserving colors and ambient occlusion.
option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH=Sunlight strength
option.SUNLIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Sun-facing light and outdoor shade tint. Places the sky barely reaches never receive direct sun, so roofs and caves do not leak light.
option.SHADOWS=Cast shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Terrain, vegetation, player and special renderers. 2048 map, 64-block range.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Continuous nine-tap filter softness with receiver-plane slope correction.
option.SHADOW_BIAS=Shadow stripe correction
option.SHADOW_BIAS.comment=Default 1.0. Increase for remaining acne; high values may detach contact shadows.
option.WATER_STRENGTH=Water strength
option.WATER_STRENGTH.comment=Waves, reflections, sun glint and depth: clear shallow shores, richer deep water.
option.WATER_EFFECT=Continuous water surface
option.WATER_EFFECT.comment=Continuous wave normals and reduced texture contrast. Vanilla water only.
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Scene reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=0: approximate sky. 1: 12 steps. 2: 24 steps. Off-screen objects cannot appear.
option.WATER_TEXTURE=Water texture detail
option.WATER_TEXTURE.comment=Lower values soften the repeating pattern. Alpha and other liquids are unchanged.
option.ANTIALIASING=FXAA antialiasing
option.ANTIALIASING.comment=Spatial edge smoothing. This is not DLSS or temporal reconstruction.
option.SHARPNESS=Adaptive sharpness
option.SHARPNESS.comment=Clamps detail to nearby colors to avoid halos and preserve smoothed edges.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Soft bloom
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Filtered glow with bounded contribution and resize-safe buffers. Zero disables it.
option.HIGHLIGHT_COMPRESSION=Highlight compression
option.HIGHLIGHT_COMPRESSION.comment=Softens values above 0.72 without darkening midtones. Cannot recover already clipped detail.
option.FOG_STRENGTH=Distance fog strength
option.EARTH_EFFECTS=Earth atmosphere
option.EARTH_EFFECTS.comment=Turn off for a custom dimension sharing Earth biome IDs. Unknown biomes are protected.
