option.FOLIAGE_FILTER=Distant foliage filter
option.FOLIAGE_FILTER.comment=Rejects weak distant fringes while preserving RC-2 mip colors and coverage.
option.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS=Local light shadows
option.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS.comment=Experimental. Requires the separate Gentle Lights companion mod (not included); without it this option has no effect. Costly with many lights.
value.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS.0=Off
value.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS.1=Mild (8 sources)
value.LOCAL_LIGHT_SHADOWS.2=Strong (8 sources)
screen.BLOCKLIGHT=Torches and lamps
option.BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH=Torch light warmth
option.BLOCKLIGHT_WARMTH.comment=Warm, slightly brighter light around torches, lamps and lava. Daylight outdoors is unchanged. Zero keeps vanilla light.
option.TORCH_FLICKER=Flame flicker
option.TORCH_FLICKER.comment=Torch flames, fire and their glow flicker, each with its own rhythm. Light on walls stays steady.
value.TORCH_FLICKER.0=Off
value.TORCH_FLICKER.1=On
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT=Handheld light
option.HANDHELD_LIGHT.comment=Holding a torch, glowstone or any light-emitting item lights the area around you.
value.HANDHELD_LIGHT.0=Off
value.HANDHELD_LIGHT.1=On
option.EMISSIVE_GLOW=Flame glow
option.EMISSIVE_GLOW.comment=Soft halo around torch flames, fire, lava, glowstone and flame particles. Zero disables it.
